comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T15:15:30.124Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict all-status corpus plus fresh searches and open/in-progress lists found no exact owner. Closed pm-9x6e retains its completed hard SDK boundary. Open pm-bu8lkr owns runtime barrel loading rather than this module-usage false positive. Discovered during pm-gh1475 and grouped with its delivery."
  "2026-10-18T15:22:41.262Z","harness:codex","Negative control failed exactly as expected before implementation: nested literal lazy-used.ts was incorrectly in the orphan list. The corrected recursive walk reuses importModuleSpecifier and now passes all68 static-quality cases; computed-only and comment-only modules remain orphans. The real source scan reports zero orphan modules and zero changed-file CodeFactor complexity violations at the unchanged16 limit."
  "2026-10-18T15:30:18.702Z","harness:codex",The recursive parser refactor eliminates one grandfathered cognitive-complexity suppression. eslint --prune-suppressions removed that obsolete count and the hard MAX_ESLINT_SUPPRESSIONS ceiling was lowered from105 to104. No waiver or threshold increase was introduced.
  "2026-10-18T16:24:49.269Z","harness:codex","Full-suite evidence: 10689 tests passed, 3 skipped, and one release-automation contract failed because gate-registry.json still supplied suppression ceiling105 after the parser refactor lowered the source ceiling to104. Corrected the provider argument to104 through the tracked source file; all25 release-automation tests and the gate-registry inventory now pass. No threshold was increased. The canonical full coverage rerun follows the sequential packaged smoke."
  "2026-10-18T16:52:21.121Z","harness:codex","Verification: the complete suite passed10690 tests with3 platform skips. Its exact coverage report identified only the driver passthrough and tracker-at-Git-root hook cases; both are now covered by real filesystem tests, and the231-test focused run reports exact100/100/100/100 for driver.ts and install.ts. The two new helper modules also passed exact100/100/100/100. All linked PM tests were rerun successfully. The complete static pipeline, all TypeScript projects, release-version policy, tracked-secret scan, registry inventory and sequential npm/npx/Bun packed smoke passed. Final hosted full-population coverage and native-platform checks remain mandatory before merge; this closure records implemented, locally verified work for the reviewed delivery, not a new registry publication."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-18T15:22:42.110Z","harness:codex",Keep module-usage and SDK boundary analysis on the same AST specifier parser so literal lazy imports remain supported without eager-import workarounds or module allowances.
